  "description": "Bitcoin - S&P 500 - Robinhood - SOFI - NU - Cleanspark - Lucid - NanoX",
  "body_html": "<p>We cover a lot of different topics in this video, if you do not want to watch the entire video, the timestamps are below. Keep an eye on the government default debates that will inevitably occur as the 119th congress came in January 3rd. This will be their FIRST priority, as Janet Yellen has announced that she (the Treasury) will have to begin extraordinary measures starting the week of January 14th. This is a big deal because President Donald Trump has consistently sounded to <strong>eliminate the debt ceiling</strong>. This has caused a collision between him and conservatives in Congress. We will need to monitor who wins this fight. This will likely cause market volatility and uncertainty. Additionally we discuss the S&amp;P 500 and Bitcoin. </p><p>Grand Theft Auto 6 has <strong>A LOT</strong> of hype around it, so how will it impact Take-Two Interactive Software (TTWO) stock prices going into fall 2025? </p><p>I am available in the chat Monday to Thursday (a lot more than that, but those are the “official” hours). Dont be shy to ping me with any questions, comments, or if you just want to chat. Thank you for all of the new subscribers! Looking forward to a great 2025! 🥳</p><p><strong>Video Topics</strong></p><p>Government Default - 00:27</p><p>S&amp;P 500 - 02:43</p><p>Bitcoin - 03:45</p><p>TTWO &amp; GTA 6 - 04:38</p><p>Cleanspark - 09:20</p><p>Robinhood - 11:55</p><p>SOFI &amp; Nu - 14:48</p><p>CRISPR Therapeutics - 16:42</p><p>Why is the market so volatile?! - 17:37</p><p>Lucid or Rivian? - 20:12</p><p>Stop Losses discussion - 22:31</p><p>NanoX - 24:29</p><p>🚨 Expectations of me, and disclaimers - 25:37</p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;Timothy James&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa4c61c40-9364-4166-877a-b0163fb9610d_854x854.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
